---
import { getImage } from 'astro:assets'
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import heroSrc from './images/hero.png'

const title = '一日賺五、六萬先至明咩叫含金量 · 港股科技股實戰社群 | Gold Standard'
const description = '長期複利嘅威力，有客由 500萬 滾到近 2,000萬。一路死揸科技股，跟到嘅都飛天。專注一線 research，拆解機構交易嘅底層 logic，等散戶早人一步捉到下一個升浪。加 WhatsApp 睇今期點部署。'

const heroImg = await getImage({ src: heroSrc, format: 'webp', width: 1040, quality: 78 })
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} lang="zh-HK">
  <link slot="head" rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link slot="head" rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link
    slot="head"
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+HK:wght@500;700;900&family=Noto+Sans+HK:wght@300;400;500;700&family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;1,9..144,500;1,9..144,600&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet"
  />

  <!-- ═══════════ 背景層：暖黑 + 極弱暖光暈（無粒子 / 無網格）═══════════ -->
  <div class="bg-aurora" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="aurora a1"></span>
    <span class="aurora a2"></span>
  </div>

  <article class="feature">
    <!-- ═══════════ 開篇 · 雜誌特寫 HERO ═══════════ -->
    <header class="lede">
      <span class="rule reveal" aria-hidden="true"></span>

      <h1 class="headline reveal">
        一日賺五、六萬，<br />你先至明咩叫<span class="sheen">含金量</span>。
      </h1>

      <p class="standfirst reveal">
        講緊嘅，係長期複利嘅威力 —— 真係 <i>Gold Standard</i>。
      </p>

      <figure class="feature-img reveal">
        <img src={heroImg.src} alt="一道金光由暗處向上揚起，掠過夜色金融都市天際線" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
        <figcaption>時間，係散戶手上最硬淨嘅一條槓桿。</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="mixinJump()" class="wa-cta reveal" data-evt="hero">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12.04 2C6.58 2 2.13 6.45 2.13 11.91c0 1.75.46 3.46 1.32 4.96L2 22l5.25-1.38a9.9 9.9 0 0 0 4.79 1.22h.01c5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91 0-2.65-1.03-5.14-2.9-7.01A9.82 9.82 0 0 0 12.04 2Zm5.8 14.16c-.25.69-1.43 1.32-1.97 1.4-.5.08-1.14.11-1.84-.12-.42-.13-.97-.31-1.66-.61-2.93-1.27-4.84-4.22-4.99-4.41-.15-.2-1.19-1.58-1.19-3.01 0-1.43.75-2.13 1.02-2.42.27-.29.58-.36.78-.36.2 0 .39 0 .56.01.18.01.42-.07.66.5.25.59.83 2.02.9 2.17.07.15.12.32.02.51-.09.2-.14.32-.27.49-.14.17-.29.38-.41.51-.14.14-.28.29-.12.57.16.27.71 1.17 1.52 1.9 1.05.93 1.93 1.22 2.21 1.36.27.14.43.12.59-.07.16-.2.68-.79.86-1.07.18-.27.36-.22.61-.13.25.09 1.6.75 1.87.89.27.14.45.2.52.32.07.12.07.69-.18 1.38Z"></path></svg>
        搵助理即時回覆 · 加 WhatsApp
      </a>
      <p class="cta-sub reveal">睇下今期科技股點部署 · 邊隻最有得諗</p>
    </header>

    <!-- ═══════════ 複利特寫（大字戰績 · 不對稱）═══════════ -->
    <section class="figure-feature reveal">
      <span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="ff-grid">
        <div class="ff-num">
          <span class="ff-from">由 <b id="recFrom">500</b> 萬</span>
          <svg class="ff-arr" viewBox="0 0 48 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 7h42M39 2l5 5-5 5"></path></svg>
          <span class="ff-to">滾到近 <b id="recTo">2,000</b> 萬</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ff-body">
          <p>有個客，一路死揸科技股，跟到嘅都 take off，直頭飛天。由 500 萬滾到近 2,000 萬 —— 時間越耐，複利越睇得出威力。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════ 價值 · 散文式（無卡片）═══════════ -->
    <section class="brief">
      <div class="brief-item reveal">
        <h2>破解機構交易密碼</h2>
        <p>專注一線 research，拆解機構 trade 嘅底層 logic。等散戶唔使再蝕喺資訊不對稱，早人一步捉到下一個升浪。</p>
      </div>
      <span class="rule thin" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="brief-item reveal">
        <h2>最明白散戶嘅實戰高手</h2>
        <p>冇咁多花巧理論，淨係每日實戰 re-cap，幫你理清行情主線、拆清楚升跌 logic。無論你係初哥，定係輸開錢嘅老散，都可以慢慢建立返自己一套 Trading System。</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════ 大字引文（社會證明）═══════════ -->
    <section class="voices reveal">
      <p class="voices-lead">圈內近 <b>3,000</b> 位科技股玩家，每日一齊睇市、傾部署。</p>
      <blockquote class="pull">
        死揸咗一年科技股，今次真係明咩叫含金量。每日 re-cap 拆得好清楚，唔使再喺度估。
      </blockquote>
      <cite class="pull-by">陳生 · 跟咗大半年</cite>
      <blockquote class="pull sub">
        以前淨係識追高殺低，而家識睇返機構嗰邊嘅 logic，慢慢建立到自己套嘢。
      </blockquote>
      <cite class="pull-by">阿 Ken · 由新手入圈</cite>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════ 收結 CTA（克制高級）═══════════ -->
    <section class="closing reveal">
      <span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <h2 class="closing-h">想跟住我哋一齊玩？</h2>
      <p class="closing-p">搵助理即時回覆，睇下今期科技股點部署、邊隻最有得諗。</p>
      <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="mixinJump()" class="wa-cta" data-evt="final">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12.04 2C6.58 2 2.13 6.45 2.13 11.91c0 1.75.46 3.46 1.32 4.96L2 22l5.25-1.38a9.9 9.9 0 0 0 4.79 1.22h.01c5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91 0-2.65-1.03-5.14-2.9-7.01A9.82 9.82 0 0 0 12.04 2Zm5.8 14.16c-.25.69-1.43 1.32-1.97 1.4-.5.08-1.14.11-1.84-.12-.42-.13-.97-.31-1.66-.61-2.93-1.27-4.84-4.22-4.99-4.41-.15-.2-1.19-1.58-1.19-3.01 0-1.43.75-2.13 1.02-2.42.27-.29.58-.36.78-.36.2 0 .39 0 .56.01.18.01.42-.07.66.5.25.59.83 2.02.9 2.17.07.15.12.32.02.51-.09.2-.14.32-.27.49-.14.17-.29.38-.41.51-.14.14-.28.29-.12.57.16.27.71 1.17 1.52 1.9 1.05.93 1.93 1.22 2.21 1.36.27.14.43.12.59-.07.16-.2.68-.79.86-1.07.18-.27.36-.22.61-.13.25.09 1.6.75 1.87.89.27.14.45.2.52.32.07.12.07.69-.18 1.38Z"></path></svg>
        加 WhatsApp 搵助理
      </a>    </section>
  </article>

  <!-- ═══════════ 底部 STICKY CTA ═══════════ -->
  <div class="sticky-cta" id="stickyCta">
    <div class="sc-txt"><b>科技股實戰圈</b><span>搵助理睇今期部署</span></div>
    <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="mixinJump()" class="sc-btn" data-evt="sticky">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12.04 2C6.58 2 2.13 6.45 2.13 11.91c0 1.75.46 3.46 1.32 4.96L2 22l5.25-1.38a9.9 9.9 0 0 0 4.79 1.22h.01c5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91 0-2.65-1.03-5.14-2.9-7.01A9.82 9.82 0 0 0 12.04 2Zm5.8 14.16c-.25.69-1.43 1.32-1.97 1.4-.5.08-1.14.11-1.84-.12-.42-.13-.97-.31-1.66-.61-2.93-1.27-4.84-4.22-4.99-4.41-.15-.2-1.19-1.58-1.19-3.01 0-1.43.75-2.13 1.02-2.42.27-.29.58-.36.78-.36.2 0 .39 0 .56.01.18.01.42-.07.66.5.25.59.83 2.02.9 2.17.07.15.12.32.02.51-.09.2-.14.32-.27.49-.14.17-.29.38-.41.51-.14.14-.28.29-.12.57.16.27.71 1.17 1.52 1.9 1.05.93 1.93 1.22 2.21 1.36.27.14.43.12.59-.07.16-.2.68-.79.86-1.07.18-.27.36-.22.61-.13.25.09 1.6.75 1.87.89.27.14.45.2.52.32.07.12.07.69-.18 1.38Z"></path></svg>
      加入
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══════════ JS（無粒子；保留 reveal / 戰績 countup / sticky）═══════════ -->
  <script is:inline>
// ── 滾動入場 ──
function initReveal() {
  const els = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.reveal'))
  function check() {
    const h = window.innerHeight
    for (let i = els.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
      if (els[i].getBoundingClientRect().top < h * 0.9) {
        els[i].classList.add('in')
        els.splice(i, 1)
      }
    }
  }
  check()
  window.addEventListener('scroll', check, { passive: true })
  window.addEventListener('resize', check, { passive: true })
}

// ── 戰績 countup（500 → 近 2,000）──
function runRecord() {
  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches
  const from = document.getElementById('recFrom')
  const to = document.getElementById('recTo')
  if (!from || !to)
    return
  if (reduce) {
    from.textContent = '500'
    to.textContent = '2,000'
    return
  }
  const rec = document.querySelector('.figure-feature')
  let done = false
  function ease(t) { return 1 - (1 - t) ** 3 }
  function run() {
    const start = performance.now()
    const dur = 1400
    function step(now) {
      const t = Math.min(1, (now - start) / dur)
      const e = ease(t)
      from.textContent = Math.round(500 * e).toLocaleString('en-US')
      to.textContent = Math.round(2000 * e).toLocaleString('en-US')
      if (t < 1)
        requestAnimationFrame(step)
    }
    requestAnimationFrame(step)
  }
  function check() {
    if (done || !rec)
      return
    if (rec.getBoundingClientRect().top < window.innerHeight * 0.9) {
      done = true
      run()
    }
  }
  check()
  window.addEventListener('scroll', check, { passive: true })
}

// ── 底部 sticky CTA：滾動超過首屏先顯示 ──
function initSticky() {
  const sc = document.getElementById('stickyCta')
  const lede = document.querySelector('.lede')
  if (!sc || !lede)
    return
  function check() {
    sc.classList.toggle('show', window.scrollY > lede.offsetHeight * 0.6)
  }
  check()
  window.addEventListener('scroll', check, { passive: true })
}

document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
  initReveal()
  runRecord()
  initSticky()
})
  </script>

  <!-- ═══════════ CSS（編輯 / 雜誌特寫）═══════════ -->
  <style is:global>
    :root {
      --bg: #0b0a07;
      --gold: #d4af37;
      --gold-li: #f5d77a;
      --gold-dk: #b8860b;
      --wa: #25d366;
      --wa2: #1fb457;
      --tx: #f3ecdb;
      --tx2: #b3a585;
      --tx3: #7a715c;
      --line: rgba(212, 175, 55, .2);
    }

    html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--tx);
      font-family: 'Noto Sans HK', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-weight: 300;
      margin: 0;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    /* ── 背景：暖黑 + 兩團極弱暖光暈 ── */
    .bg-aurora { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; overflow: hidden; }
    .aurora { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(90px); }
    .aurora.a1 { top: -18%; left: -10%; width: 76vw; height: 76vw; max-width: 520px; max-height: 520px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(212, 175, 55, .1), transparent 70%); }
    .aurora.a2 { bottom: 2%; right: -18%; width: 70vw; height: 70vw; max-width: 480px; max-height: 480px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(184, 134, 11, .08), transparent 70%); }

    /* ── 文章容器 ── */
    .feature { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px 120px; box-sizing: border-box; }

    /* ── reveal ── */
    .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); transition: opacity .8s ease, transform .8s cubic-bezier(.2, .7, .2, 1); }
    .reveal.in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }

    /* ── 發絲線（結構分隔，編輯感）── */
    .rule { display: block; height: 1px; width: 100%; border: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold-dk), rgba(212, 175, 55, .14) 60%, transparent); }
    .rule.thin { background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(212, 175, 55, .26), transparent 70%); margin: 26px 0; }

    /* ── 開篇 ── */
    .lede { padding-top: 46px; }
    .lede .rule { margin-bottom: 26px; }
    .headline {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif HK', serif;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: clamp(2.05rem, 9.2vw, 3.1rem);
      line-height: 1.24;
      letter-spacing: -.012em;
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      color: var(--tx);
    }
    .sheen {
      background: linear-gradient(100deg, var(--gold-dk) 0%, var(--gold) 22%, #fff7e0 42%, var(--gold-li) 56%, var(--gold) 74%, var(--gold-dk) 100%);
      background-size: 220% 100%;
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      animation: sheen 4.8s linear infinite;
    }
    .standfirst {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif HK', serif;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: clamp(1.04rem, 4.4vw, 1.22rem);
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--tx2);
      margin: 0 0 30px;
      max-width: 30ch;
    }
    .standfirst i { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-style: italic; color: var(--gold-li); font-weight: 600; }

    .feature-img { margin: 0 0 30px; }
    .feature-img img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 4px; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; object-fit: cover; box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, .6); }
    .feature-img figcaption {
      font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Noto Serif HK', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: .82rem;
      color: var(--tx3);
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding-left: 14px;
      border-left: 2px solid var(--gold-dk);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* ── CTA ── */
    .wa-cta { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 17px; border-radius: 13px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--wa), var(--wa2)); color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.02rem; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(37, 211, 102, .3); }
    .wa-cta svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .wa-cta:hover { box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(37, 211, 102, .46); }
    .cta-sub { font-size: .76rem; color: var(--tx3); margin: 12px 0 0; text-align: center; }

    /* ── 複利特寫 ── */
    .figure-feature { margin-top: 64px; }
    .figure-feature .rule { margin-bottom: 26px; }
    .ff-num { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; font-family: 'Noto Serif HK', serif; }
    .ff-from, .ff-to { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--tx2); font-weight: 500; }
    .ff-num b { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 16vw, 4.6rem); line-height: .96; color: var(--gold-li); letter-spacing: -.02em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; display: inline-block; margin-right: 2px; }
    .ff-from b { color: var(--tx2); }
    .ff-arr { width: 46px; height: 14px; color: var(--gold); margin: 8px 0; }
    .ff-body p { font-size: .98rem; line-height: 1.85; color: var(--tx2); margin: 22px 0 0; max-width: 36ch; }

    /* ── 價值 · 散文 ── */
    .brief { margin-top: 60px; }
    .brief-item h2 { font-family: 'Noto Serif HK', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.32rem; color: var(--tx); margin: 0 0 12px; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
    .brief-item p { font-size: .96rem; line-height: 1.82; color: var(--tx2); margin: 0; max-width: 40ch; }

    /* ── 大字引文 ── */
    .voices { margin-top: 60px; }
    .voices-lead { font-size: .92rem; color: var(--tx2); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 30px; }
    .voices-lead b { color: var(--gold-li); font-weight: 700; }
    .pull {
      position: relative;
      font-family: 'Noto Serif HK', serif;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: clamp(1.32rem, 5.6vw, 1.7rem);
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--tx);
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      padding-top: 30px;
    }
    .pull::before { content: '\201C'; position: absolute; top: -10px; left: -4px; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 4rem; line-height: 1; color: var(--gold-dk); opacity: .7; }
    .pull.sub { font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 4.6vw, 1.3rem); color: var(--tx2); margin-top: 40px; }
    .pull-by { display: block; font-size: .8rem; color: var(--tx3); font-style: normal; letter-spacing: .02em; }

    /* ── 收結 CTA ── */
    .closing { margin-top: 64px; text-align: center; }
    .closing .rule { margin: 0 auto 30px; }
    .closing-h { font-family: 'Noto Serif HK', serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 7vw, 2.1rem); color: var(--tx); margin: 0 0 12px; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
    .closing-p { font-size: .92rem; color: var(--tx2); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 auto 26px; max-width: 32ch; }
    .closing .wa-cta { max-width: 380px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .risk { font-size: .68rem; color: var(--tx3); margin: 18px auto 0; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 38ch; }

    /* ── sticky CTA ── */
    .sticky-cta { position: fixed; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; z-index: 200; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 11px 16px calc(11px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); background: rgba(11, 10, 7, .94); backdrop-filter: blur(14px); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); transform: translateY(110%); transition: transform .35s cubic-bezier(.2, .7, .2, 1); }
    .sticky-cta.show { transform: none; }
    .sc-txt { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
    .sc-txt b { display: block; font-size: .84rem; color: var(--tx); font-family: 'Noto Serif HK', serif; font-weight: 700; }
    .sc-txt span { font-size: .68rem; color: var(--tx3); }
    .sc-btn { flex-shrink: 0; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 11px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--wa), var(--wa2)); color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: .9rem; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(37, 211, 102, .32); }
    .sc-btn svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }

    /* ── keyframes ── */
    @keyframes sheen { 0% { background-position: 200% 0; } 100% { background-position: -20% 0; } }

    /* ── 桌面增強：複利特寫做不對稱雙欄 ── */
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .ff-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr; gap: 36px; align-items: center; }
      .ff-body p { margin-top: 0; }
      .feature-img img { aspect-ratio: 2 / 1; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .wa-cta, .sheen { animation: none !important; }
      .reveal { transition: none; opacity: 1; transform: none; }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
